run_log.jsonl
.llm_call_budget.json

# Source book PDFs — don't commit copies of published/licensed text into
# git history. Was NOT excluded before; a 2.3MB book was about to be
# staged. Store source PDFs outside the repo, or in a gitignored
# /sources/ subfolder, and keep only the pipeline code under version control.
*.pdf